      "id": "unusual",
      "name": "Unusual or unexpected",
      "weight": 3,
      "min_score": 2,
      "_why": "The single best predictor that something is worth a reader's attention. Institutions write in a flat register; the words below are what they use when something has actually gone wrong or broken precedent.",
